# Normalize line endings. Store text as LF in the repository and check it out
# as LF on every platform, so gofmt/CI stay consistent regardless of a
# developer's core.autocrlf setting on Windows.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Go toolchain (gofmt) expects LF.
*.go text eol=lf

# Shell scripts must stay LF to remain executable.
*.sh text eol=lf

# Treat common binary assets as binary so they are never line-ending munged.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
